  "text_sanskrit": "सञ्जय उवाच । एतच्छ्रुत्वा वचनं केशवस्य कृताञ्जलिर्वेपमानः किरीटी । नमस्कृत्वा भूय एवाह कृष्णं सगद्गदं भीतभीतः प्रणम्य ॥ ११-३५ ॥",
  "itrans": "sa~njaya uvAcha . etachChrutvA vachanaM keshavasya kR^itA~njalirvepamAnaH kirITI . namaskR^itvA bhUya evAha kR^iShNaM sagadgadaM bhItabhItaH praNamya .. 11-35 ..",
  "translation": "Sanjaya said: Having heard this word of Krishna with joined hands; Kiriti, trembling, bowed down again, spoke to Krishna in a faltering voice, very much terrified and bowing. (35)",
